stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> CREATED
    CREATED --> PLAYER_READY: SYSTEM_START / enter turn, terminal guard
    CREATED --> TERMINAL: entry death terminal
    PLAYER_READY --> PLAYER_READY: PLAY_CARD / commit nonterminal
    PLAYER_READY --> TERMINAL: PLAY_CARD / drain reactions then finish
    PLAYER_READY --> ENEMY_READY: END_TURN / 1 commit
    ENEMY_READY --> PLAYER_TURN_PENDING: SYSTEM_ENEMY_ACTION / nonterminal
    ENEMY_READY --> TERMINAL: SYSTEM_ENEMY_ACTION / terminal
    PLAYER_TURN_PENDING --> PLAYER_READY: SYSTEM_ENTER_PLAYER_TURN / DOT then refresh+draw
    PLAYER_TURN_PENDING --> TERMINAL: OWNER_TURN_ENTER DOT terminal
    CREATED --> ABORTED: ABORT
    PLAYER_READY --> ABORTED: ABORT
    ENEMY_READY --> ABORTED: ABORT
    PLAYER_TURN_PENDING --> ABORTED: ABORT
    CREATED --> FAULTED: internal invariant failure
    PLAYER_READY --> FAULTED: internal invariant failure
    ENEMY_READY --> FAULTED: internal invariant failure
    PLAYER_TURN_PENDING --> FAULTED: internal invariant failure
    TERMINAL --> [*]
    ABORTED --> [*]
    FAULTED --> [*]
    note right of PLAYER_READY
      P14 is the only BattleState writer
      RESOLVING is internal and never published
      invalid and duplicate requests are no-ops
    end note
    note right of TERMINAL
      WIN / LOSS / DRAW mutually exclusive
      BATTLE_FINISHED exactly once
      no new gameplay commands
    end note
